{"task_id": "Mbpp/87", "solution": "def merge_dictionaries_three(a: dict, b: dict, c: dict) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Return a new dict containing all key-value pairs from a, b, and c. Does not modify inputs.\"\"\"\n    merged = {}\n    merged.update(a)\n    merged.update(b)\n    merged.update(c)\n    return merged"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/89", "solution": "from math import floor\n\ndef closest_num(n):\n    \"\"\"Return the greatest integer strictly less than n.\n    If n is an integer or a float with an integer value, return n - 1; otherwise, return floor(n).\n    \"\"\"\n    if n % 1 == 0:\n        return int(n) - 1\n    else:\n        return floor(n)"}
